              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hobilars have hand weapon, thrusting or throwing spear and shield. Light Cavalry. May have light armour (+2). One unit of Hobilars may be upgraded to Irish Horse (+3). Irish Horse may not take light armour, but have Feigned Flight.</characteristic>
