              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Levy Archers have improvised weapon and longbow. Open Order. Levies. May not have a standard or musician. If the army includes Levy Archers, it may not include Seasoned Archers, or any Allies &amp; Mercenaries.</characteristic>
